{
  "name": "Daily call report by email",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily call report by email\n\n**What it does**\nAt 18:00 every day, reads today's calls from the Google Sheet that workflow 01 fills, writes a short digest (how many calls, hot leads, who to call back first) and emails it to you. Quiet days get a one-line email instead.\n\n**You need**\n- The `Calls` sheet from workflow 01 (or any sheet with a `Date` column in `yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm`)\n- OpenAI API key\n- Gmail connected to n8n\n\n**Setup**\n1. Paste your sheet ID into **Read the call log**.\n2. Put your email address in both Gmail nodes.\n3. Check the workflow time zone (Settings, Timezone), then activate it.\n\nBuilt by AI Strike Force, aistrikeforce.com",
        "height": 700,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "1fc4d8af-72fa-57a7-b054-08bd0f42b8a4",
      "name": "Daily call report by email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Edit me\n**Read the call log**: your sheet ID.\n**Email the report** and **Email: quiet day**: your address.\n**Every day at 18:00**: change the time if you close earlier.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "85d23444-627d-52f9-a5fc-2c8660542d83",
      "name": "Edit me: sheet and email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -300
      ]
    },
